<div class="font-compare">
  <div class="sample current">
    <p class="label">现状：Kalam + Patrick Hand，中文走系统黑体</p>
    <h2 class="h">Attention Is All You Need · 精读笔记</h2>
    <p class="p">
      完全抛弃循环与卷积，仅用注意力机制建模序列依赖。除以 √d 是为了防止点积过大导致 softmax 进入梯度极小的区域。
      A robot must be embodied to understand the world it acts in.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="sample proposed">
    <p class="label">提案：Caveat 标题 + 霞鹜文楷正文（中英同一字体）</p>
